Following Jeong et al,38 the release profiles were plotted against the square root of time, revealing pseudo-linear curves indicative of diffusion-dominated drug release, consistent with the Higuchi equation for all BSA release profiles. Therefore, based on the late time approximation in equation 5, a linear plot of \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
